    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "In response to critics of the casting, a counter-argument was made in defense of the artistic choice. This defense statement asserted that inclusive storytelling is not erasure but evolution, treating the Western canon as shared civilizational heritage for a modern audience. The fight now extends beyond the film to a larger public debate over who gets to tell these stories.",
